# Override the backend API base URL for local development or troubleshooting.
# Copy to .env.local for local dev with a separate API server.
# When unset, the app uses relative URLs (same-origin) — this is what
# the Replit workspace preview wants, so leave it unset there.
# In production each .env.production hard-codes this to
#   https://api.rathinamcracker.com
# To talk to a non-default API during incidents, set this here.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
